  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Thursday 19 November 2026 at 4:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nBeach days, school runs, weekend sport and everyday essentials – all within an easy walk! Set on a 637sqm (more or less) freehold section, this freshly renovated, move- in-ready home combines flexible living, elevated sea views and an enviable Stanmore Bay location, with beach access just steps from the end of the cul-de-sac.\r\n\r\nImagine relaxing in your upstairs living room, watching the games unfold across Stanmore Bay's sports fields, or heading out for a morning stroll along the sand. It's a lifestyle the whole family will love!\r\n\r\nFreshly painted inside and out, with new flooring, carpet and LED lighting, the four-bedroom main residence offers bright, welcoming spaces designed for comfortable family living. The elevated lounge captures beautiful sea and park views, while a heat pump and HRV ventilation system provide year-round comfort.\r\n\r\nThe fourth bedroom adds extra flexibility, with sliding-door access to a carport making it ideal as a home office, creative workspace or private retreat.\r\n\r\nA fantastic bonus is the two-bedroom downstairs area, complete with its own entrance, dedicated parking, living facilities, heat pump and separate power panel.\r\n\r\nOffering added privacy and independence, this versatile space is ideal for extended family, guests or changing household needs, with further possibilities subject to the necessary approvals.\r\n\r\nA dedicated entertaining area between the main home and standalone double garage provides the perfect setting for summer barbecues and gatherings, while the grassed backyard offers room for gardening, a trampoline or children's play.\r\n\r\nA workshop with sliding-door access adds flexibility for hobbies or a home workspace, while generous off-street parking provides room for a boat or caravan.\r\n\r\nFeatures You'll Love:\r\n\r\n•  Four-bedroom main home plus versatile two-bedroom downstairs area\r\n•  Three bathrooms and separate laundry\r\n•  637sqm (more or less) freehold section\r\n•  Freshly painted interior and exterior, new flooring, carpet and LED lighting\r\n•  Heat pump and HRV system upstairs, plus an additional heat pump downstairs\r\n•  Separate downstairs entrance, parking and power panel\r\n•  Flexible fourth bedroom with direct carport access\r\n•  Standalone double garage, carport and workshop\r\n•  Outdoor entertaining area, grassed backyard and parking for a boat or caravan\r\n•  Elevated sea views overlooking Stanmore Bay sports fields\r\n•  Beach access just steps from the end of the cul-de-sac\r\n•  Walking distance to Stanmore Bay Park, Pool and Leisure Centre, supermarkets, childcare and local amenities\r\n•  In zone for Whangaparaoa Primary School and Whangaparaoa College\r\n\r\nWalk to Everything, Love Every Day!\r\n\r\nFrom kayaking, surfing and fishing to weekend sport and family outings, there's plenty to enjoy right on your doorstep. With schools, shops and recreational facilities nearby, everyday life is wonderfully convenient.\r\n\r\nLooking ahead, the Penlink transport connection is expected to further improve access between the Whangaparaoa Peninsula and the wider Auckland network.\r\n\r\nOne Fantastic Location. Flexible Living. So Many Possibilities!\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a family home, space for extended family or work-from- home flexibility, this property offers an exciting opportunity in a location that's hard to beat.\r\n\r\nCome and experience the views, space and lifestyle for yourself. Contact us today to arrange your viewing or visit the next open home!",
